OL,3,GNEWSAThree re-arrested over Moss Side
OL,4,Astabbing death
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree people have been re-arrested by
OL,7,Fpolice investigating the fatal stabbing
OL,8,Fof a father of three in Manchester,
OL,9,Fpolice have said.
OL,11,FA 17-year-old boy and an 18-year-old
OL,12,Fman were arrested on suspicion of
OL,13,Fmurder, while a 27-year-old woman was
OL,14,Farrested on suspicion of assisting an
OL,15,Foffender, Greater Manchester Police
OL,16,F(GMP) said.
OL,18,FAll three had previously been arrested
OL,19,Fand bailed in connection with the death
OL,20,Fof Adrian Brown, 34, and remain in
OL,21,Fcustody for questioning.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
